# Frontend build configuration. Copy to .env only if you need it; every value here is public
# by design, so never put a secret, API key or database credential in this file.

# Origin of the backend API.
# Leave EMPTY when the Express server serves this frontend (same origin) - that is the default.
# Set it only when the frontend is deployed on its own host, e.g. https://api.example.edu.eg
# See the note in README.md: a separate origin also requires CORS and SameSite=None; Secure
# on the backend session cookie, which the backend must be configured for.
API_BASE_URL=